{"id":58934,"date":"2022-01-31T15:51:07","date_gmt":"2022-01-31T10:21:07","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/websitedemos.net\/?post_type=astra-sites&#038;p=58934"},"modified":"2024-04-05T11:23:06","modified_gmt":"2024-04-05T05:53:06","slug":"real-estate-consultant","status":"publish","type":"astra-sites","link":"https:\/\/websitedemos.net\/astra-site\/real-estate-consultant\/","title":{"rendered":"Real Estate Consultant"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>The Real Estate Consultant template could easily be used for any type of consultant. It\u2019s bright and breezy with a welcoming feel and a contact box front and center.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The rest of the design uses light complementing colors and modern sans serif fonts to create subtle authority while remaining accessible. The template comes with flexible content areas and extra pages you can customize as you see fit.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key features of the Real Estate Consultant template<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Attractive design suitable for any type of consultant<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Warm and welcoming with appealing colors<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Contact form front and center to capture leads<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Flexible content blocks throughout<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Additional pages can be customized to suit any requirement<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Compatible with popular drag and drop page builders<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Deliver the professional look and feel that gives customers the confidence they need<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":190,"featured_media":59147,"template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"inline_featured_image":false,"_uag_custom_page_level_css":"","site-sidebar-layout":"default","site-content-layout":"","ast-site-content-layout":"default","site-content-style":"default","site-sidebar-style":"default","ast-global-header-display":"","ast-banner-title-visibility":"","ast-main-header-display":"","ast-hfb-above-header-display":"","ast-hfb-below-he